  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>Timeline view shows a feed's items as a scrollable stack of snapshots — handy for catching up on what changed.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Open Timeline",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap the <strong>Timeline</strong> icon from the feed list or a feed dashboard. Switch to <strong>portrait</strong> when prompted. Pick a feed tile, or <strong>All</strong> to see every feed you follow.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/0087614f5756a67b.webp",
              "width": 800,
              "height": 270
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Read and act on snapshots",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Each snapshot shows the <strong>callsign</strong>, time, location and a map capture; tap it to show the item on the map.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tap the <strong>⋮</strong> on a snapshot for <strong>View Details → History</strong> (revert to an earlier version), <strong>Save screenshot</strong>, <strong>Contact Author</strong> or <strong>Undo</strong>.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/8d81d2ed4a45a4eb.webp",
              "width": 800,
              "height": 1473
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
